格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"决策分屏：DSH Web UI 主窗口摘要+决策编辑，右侧详情栏完整 markdown 展示，决策一键回传 agent","id":"gh:1340370351","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-decision-split","slug":"yuanbaoerer/dsh-decision-split","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"决策分屏：DSH Web UI 主窗口摘要+决策编辑，右侧详情栏完整 markdown 展示，决策一键回传 agent"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-decision-split"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> A split-view reader for long AI agent responses in the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-decision-split` is an open-source DSH Web UI plugin that lets you read a completed assistant me"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ssage in a **native right-side tab**, without losing your place in the main conversation. The select"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ed message has its own scrollable Markdown view, so you can reference long responses while continuin"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"s own scrollable Markdown view, so you can reference long responses while continuing to work in DSH."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Package:** dsh-decision-split on npm\n- **Releases:** GitHub Releases\n- **License:** MIT"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Open a completed response:** Adds a “在侧栏查看全文” (“View full message in sidebar”) action to complet"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ed assistant messages containing text. The action does not appear while a response is still being ge"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"nerated.\n- **Read full Markdown:** Displays the selected message in a separately scrollable panel, i"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ncluding tables, code blocks, and inline code.\n- **Switch without duplicate tabs:** Selecting anothe"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"r message updates the existing plugin tab rather than opening a new one.\n- **Use DSH's native sideba"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"r:** On DSH 0.2.x, the plugin uses the built-in rightbar tab system, including native close/collapse"},{"id":"p8s7","text":" controls and user-adjustable width.\n- **Keep existing message actions:** Integrates with `conversat"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ion.chat.assistant-actions` alongside the host's built-in actions, such as deliverables and feedback"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"on.chat.assistant-actions` alongside the host's built-in actions, such as deliverables and feedback."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This is a **read-only message viewer**. It does not add decision forms, an embedded prompt field, or"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" automatic decision submission; use DSH's native `ask_user_question` flow for interactive decisions."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"*The screenshot shows the earlier DSH 0.1.x interface. Plugin v0.2.5 uses DSH 0.2.x's native rightba"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"r tab layout instead.*"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### DSH 0.2.x (current plugin)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Install the latest published version from npm:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Restart your running `dsh web` process after installation."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Alternatively, install the v0.2.5 release archive directly:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> **Compatibility:** v0.2.5 was tested with DSH `0.2.1-rc.2`. Compatibility with every future DSH 0."},{"id":"p19s2","text":"2.x release is not guaranteed; check the compatibility notes when upgrading."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### DSH 0.1.x (legacy)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Use plugin **v0.2.4** instead of v0.2.5:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Plugin v0.2.4 was tested with DSH `0.1.2-rc.1`. The newer rightbar implementation is not compatible "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"with the old DSH 0.1.x layout."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Open your conversation in `dsh web` and wait for an assistant response to finish.\n2. Click **“在侧栏"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"查看全文”** at the end of a text response.\n3. Read its full Markdown in the right-side tab. Click the ac"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"tion on another completed message to switch the content in the same tab.\n4. Close the tab or collaps"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"e the right sidebar using DSH's own controls."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"No plugin-specific configuration is required."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| DSH version | Plugin version | Verified result |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| `0.2.1-rc.2` | `0.2.5` | ✅ Verified with runtime end-to-end checks (October 19, 2026) |\n| `0.1.2-r"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"c.1` | `0.2.4` | ✅ Verified (September 7, 2026) |\n| `0.2.1-rc.2` | `0.2.4` | ❌ Incompatible: DSH rem"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"oved the legacy details/sidebar APIs |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"See `docs/COMPATIBILITY.md` for specific API changes, validation steps, and test notes."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- The sidebar action appears only for completed text-containing assistant messages with a message ID"},{"id":"p32s2","text":".\n- In DSH 0.2.x, a tab restored after refreshing the page may not retain the previously selected me"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ssage and can show an empty state.\n- Sidebar width is managed by DSH, not forced by this plugin.\n- C"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ompatibility with plugins that also customize the right sidebar has not been comprehensively verifie"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"patibility with plugins that also customize the right sidebar has not been comprehensively verified."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development and contributing"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The v0.2.5 implementation registers a rightbar tab via `ctx.sidebarRightTabs` and opens it through `"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ctx.sidebarRight.openTab`. Message actions are registered in `conversation.chat.assistant-actions`; "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"the tab's content and title use the native sidebar slots."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For the project layout, local development workflow, and release process, see `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Bug reports and contributions are welcome through GitHub Issues. If reporting a compatibility proble"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"m, include the DSH version, plugin version, steps to reproduce, and any relevant console errors."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"MIT."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
